# Virtual copies.
variants.create = Yakha ikhophi lebonakalako…
variants.rename = Shintja ligama lekhophi lebonakalako…
variants.delete = Susa ikhophi lebonakalako
variants.close = Vala lesitfombe nemakhophi aso labonakalako ngaphambi kwekuwahambisa noma kuwasusa.
variants.saved_hint = Ikhophi icala ekuhlelweni lokugciniwe, noma esitfombeni sekucala nangabe kute lokuhleliwe. Gcina lushintjo lolungakagcinwa kucala.
variants.move_original = Hambisa sitfombe sekucala kuze kuhambiseke nemakhophi aso labonakalako.
variants.protected_export = Khetsa lenye indzawo. Titfombe letikhishwa kuGalari angeke titsatse indzawo yesitfombe sekucala noma yendzawo lokugcinwa kuyo kuhlelwa kwaso.
